1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:04,025
9 MINERS WERE TRAPPED 240 FEET UNDERGROUND

2
00:00:04,275 --> 00:00:07,558
TENS OF MILLIONS OF GALLONS OF WATER HAD FLOODED THE MINE

3
00:00:07,808 --> 00:00:11,005
THEN, FROM DEEP BELOW, RESCUERS HEARD 9 TAPS

4
00:00:11,905 --> 00:00:15,808
ON JULY 24, THEY BROKE INTO AN OLD, ABANDONED MINE

5
00:00:16,108 --> 00:00:17,167
WATER POURED IN

6
00:00:17,417 --> 00:00:18,913
ONE CREW OF 9 GOT OUT

7
00:00:19,163 --> 00:00:20,689
THE OTHER 9 WERE CUT OFF

8
00:00:21,089 --> 00:00:24,263
A NARROW HOLE BROUGHT AIR DOWN

9
00:00:24,663 --> 00:00:27,174
RESCUERS TAPPED. 3 BANGS ANSWERED

10
00:00:27,474 --> 00:00:31,832
9 TAPS: “THERE ARE NINE OF US DOWN HERE”

11
00:00:32,332 --> 00:00:35,066
ON JULY 26, THE DRILL BIT BROKE

12
00:00:35,466 --> 00:00:41,072
A BIGGER DRILL OPENED A 24-INCH HOLE FOR A RESCUE CAGE

13
00:00:41,472 --> 00:00:43,916
ONE AT A TIME, THE MINERS WERE PULLED UP

14
00:00:44,216 --> 00:00:49,130
ABOUT 77 HOURS AFTER THE FLOOD, ALL 9 WERE OUT, ALIVE

15
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:52,400
NEXT: THE THAI CAVE RESCUE. FOLLOW

